                <pb facs="0756" n="750" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg750"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May 15,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Samoan affairs, dispatch 561, England and Germany will prolong until March 31
                    next, if we agree.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phelps.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
